			PRINTFORMDW You wonder if there's anything wrong with it if you stay a while longer. You weren't planning to, but...
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕
			PRINTFORMW 「A little more...」
			PRINTFORMDW Yukari's sleeping soundly.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「......」
			PRINTFORMDW Yukari sleeps quietly, without even making a sound.
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;MASTERが起きていて、相手が起きてきた
